TLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[820,838,839,840,843,844,847,848,851],{},"Pay through a ",[798,841,842],{"href":245},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[301,845,846],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[301,849,850],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[820,853,854],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[297,856,857,860,861,864,865,460,868,864,871,864,874,877,878,881,882,885],{},[301,858,859],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[301,862,863],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[301,866,867],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[301,869,870],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[301,872,873],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[301,875,876],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[301,879,880],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[301,883,884],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[790,887,889],{"id":888},"run-this-packages-checks","Run this package's checks",[306,891,895],{"className":892,"code":893,"language":894,"meta":311,"style":311},"language-sh shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm check\n","sh",[301,896,897,909],{"__ignoreMap":311},[315,898,899,903,906],{"class":317,"line":318},[315,900,902],{"class":901},"sBMFI","pnpm",[315,904,905],{"class":342}," install",[315,907,908],{"class":342}," --frozen-lockfile\n",[315,910,911,913],{"class":317,"line":352},[315,912,902],{"class":901},[315,914,915],{"class":342}," check\n",[297,917,918],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[297,920,921,922,928,929,534],{},"See the ",[798,923,927],{"href":924,"rel":925},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[926],"nofollow","testing guide"," an